sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Dialing node
    participant Server as Listening node
    Client->>Server: TCP connection (TLS if configured)
    Client->>Server: Hello
    Server->>Server: Check protocol, formats, identity and admission
    alt Rejected
        Server-->>Client: Error when possible, then close
    else Accepted
        Server-->>Client: HelloAck with selected format
        Server->>Server: Register admitted peer
        Client->>Client: Validate ack and peer identity
        Client->>Client: Register admitted peer
        Note over Client,Server: Connection can carry CRDT traffic
    end
